{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c533","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b2ff-60d1-7b92-bcfc-8a4c766633f3"},"sequence":244,"recorded_at":1780531400000483,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"b5be48e9-caa3-42a3-a29a-786d769c2b71","payload_type":"tool.result","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"tool_result","command_id":"b5be48e9-caa3-42a3-a29a-786d769c2b71","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"b5be48e9-caa3-42a3-a29a-786d769c2b71"},"call_id":"call_01a0b30037ea703486e2c8b3f6acf8b9","text":"{\n  \"chunk_id\": \"exec-8-1\",\n  \"command\": \"ls /Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/ 2>&1; echo ===; TASK_BOARD_DIR=/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board task-board q 'get(TASK-260830-kkh1an) { full }' 2>&1 | head -100\",\n  \"description\": \"Inspect board directory layout\",\n  \"exit_code\": 0,\n  \"terminal_status\": \"completed\",\n  \"output\": \"EPIC-260829-dz9yvx_implementation-repository-foundation\\nEPIC-260830-1ewjla_advisory-human-validation\\nEPIC-260830-1uwj54_m1-single-host-durability\\nEPIC-260830-27bix9_m3-daily-driver-tmux\\nEPIC-260830-37rgqn_m0-contract-foundation\\nEPIC-260830-391tge_m4-cloning-directory-platform-release-hardening\\nEPIC-260830-3v9jlg_m2-multi-host-preview\\nEPIC-260916-18uelk_curator-environment-manager-integration\\n===\\n{\\\"ac\\\":\\\"Production behavior demonstrates: Implement absent/creating/parked/active/quiescing/stopped/stale/unavailable transitions and generation-safe evidence. Exact contract fixtures and negative/refusal cases pass; crash/idempotency evidence is included when the operation mutates durable state; no unsupported capability is advertised.\\\",\\\"assignee\\\":\\\"[implementer] developer (muse)\\\",\\\"blockedBy\\\":[\\\"TASK-260830-1geqhj\\\"],\\\"blocks\\\":[\\\"TASK-260830-2056mm\\\"],\\\"checklist\\\":[{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Production entry points implement the scoped deliverable: Implement absent/creating/parked/active/quiescing/stopped/stale/unavailable transitions and generation-safe evidence\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant positive, negative, compatibility, and recovery tests pass with logs attached\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"README/doctor/capability evidence and specification traceability are updated without unsupported claims\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Code written per task description and AC\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant tests written for new or changed behavior and passing\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"In a managed Story worktree the candidate is left UNCOMMITTED in the worktree for the handoff to snapshot — never commit on the Story branch. A producer commit moves the branch tip off the recorded checkpoint and the handoff refuses with change_request_candidate_committed_past_checkpoint; repair with `git reset --soft \\\\u003ccheckpoint_oid\\\\u003e` before completing again.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every command, message, state, or refusal named in the AC is driven through the production entry point by a named committed test, or is declared a stated bound. Report coverage as a ratio — `n of m AC rows driven` — and name the production call site for each. Prose in place of the ratio is not evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gating, refusing, validating, authorizing, or attesting behavior covered by negative tests that fail when the gate admits what it must reject, with the production call site named\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Every gate ships at least one NARROWING mutant — the gate stays present and is weakened to admit exactly one member of the class it must reject, and a named test must fail. A delete-only mutant proves only that the gate exists and is not accepted as evidence.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"A gate that inspects source text is additionally attacked by a mutant that PRESERVES the searched-for token and changes behavior, and the mutant harness executes the behavioral suite, not only the static checker.\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Lint clean\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Relevant build/validation commands run after changes and build not broken\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"New outcome artifact attached on the board with a task-scoped name when the work produces notes, logs, screenshots, or other deliverables\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Important findings, decisions, anomalies, or regressions recorded in logbook when relevant\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Implementation matches AC\\\",\\\"done\\\":false},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Solution fits project architecture\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Tests green\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"Gate, refusal, validation, authorization, and attestation behavior attacked, not read — positive-path-only evidence is not accepted\\\",\\\"done\\\":true},{\\\"text\\\":\\\"If review does not accept the work — verdict evidence added and status routed by the explicit verdict branches\\\",\\\"done\\\":true}],\\\"children\\\":[],\\\"created\\\":\\\"2026-08-29T22:00:23Z\\\",\\\"derivedBlockedBy\\\":[],\\\"derivedBlocks\\\":[],\\\"description\\\":\\\"Implement absent/creating/parked/active/quiescing/stopped/stale/unavailable transitions and generation-safe evidence. This is an implementation deliverable, not a specification rewrite.\\\",\\\"estimate\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"estimated\\\",\\\"scale\\\":{\\\"kind\\\":\\\"fibonacci\\\",\\\"number\\\":8}},\\\"id\\\":\\\"TASK-260830-kkh1an\\\",\\\"integrationCheckpointed\\\":false,\\\"isAdvisoryBlocked\\\":false,\\\"isBlocked\\\":false,\\\"name\\\":\\\"implement-terminal-instance-state-machine\\\",\\\"notes\\\":\\\"spawn workload selection: class=implementation source=explicit policy=spawn.workload_classes pair=muse/muse-spark/max pair_source=explicit match=recommended_rank_1 snapshot=sha256:009eecf230ad676c71fa02f210ad171dc6936c