ld be\n+equivalent, since the verdict never reports stale undecided).\n","edit_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","path":"internal/terminstance/TRACEABILITY.md","added":13,"removed":8},"correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"edit_file","outcome":"success"}}}
