thorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationEpochBound` |\n25|| Epoch AX number model | `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationEpochNumberModel` |\n26|| holder UUIDv7, kind closed 4, timestamps, digest | `ParseAXAuthorization` | member/kind/expiry tests |\n27|| Kind negatives attach + none (direct + nested) | `ParseAuthorizationKind`, `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAuthorizationKindClosed`, `TestParseAXAuthorizationKindClosed` |\n28|| Unknown/missing member, frame violations | `ParseAXAuthorization` | `TestParseAXAuthorizationClosedShape` |\n29|| Kind, expiry, lease binding; holder unbound (stated) | `CheckAuthorization` | `TestCheckAuthorizationAdmitsWinningLease`, `TestCheckAuthorizationRefusals` |\n30|\n31|## Closed enums and mapping (§4.C)\n32|\n33|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n34|| --- | --- | --- |\n35|| RetryDisposition closed 4 + census | `ParseRetryDisposition` | `TestParseRetryDispositionClosed`, `TestClosedEnumsAreExactlyPinned` |\n36|| Per-code mapping (26 rows; unavailable+new_authorization stated) | `DispositionFor` | `TestDispositionForMapping` |\n37|| ProviderProofKind closed 3 + classification | `ParseProviderProofKind`, `RequiresProviderObservation` | proof tests |\n38|| AuthorizationKind closed 4 + census | `ParseAuthorizationKind` | `TestParseAuthorizationKindClosed` |\n39|| Kind mapping delegates to landed column | `kindFor` → `terminalbackend.TransitionAuthorization` | `TestKindForAgreesWithLandedTable`, `TestTransitionAuthorizationReportsEveryTableColumn` |\n40|\n41|## Request/result identity (§4.C)\n42|\n43|| Clause | Production entry | Committed test |\n44|| --- | --- | --- |\n45|| MutationContext closed 10 + members, doc + Go twins | `ParseMutationContext` | `TestParseMutationContextAdmitsClosedFixture`, `TestParseMutationContextMemberRefusals`, `TestCheckMutationContextVersionArms` |\n46|| Generation 0/256/257 + multibyte | `ParseMutationContext`, `CheckMutationContext` | bound tests |\n47|| Key material exact 